 "The option values for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["ReductionIdentities"]], 
    "paclet:Matchete/ref/ReductionIdentities", "Matchete Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
