  "409b96a0-f550-4ca4-8511-f83cf128269b"],
 " are"
}], "Notes",
 CellID->622094682,ExpressionUUID->"245fc822-235c-48c3-b649-6fea3666ba87"],

Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
   {Cell["      ", "TableRowIcon",ExpressionUUID->
     "9873b65b-7b62-40e7-bc54-22f28577bcc0"], 
    TemplateBox[{
      Cell[
       TextData["dDimensional"]], "paclet:Matchete/ref/dDimensional", 
      "Matchete Package Symbol"},
     "PackageLink",
     BaseStyle->"2ColumnTableMod"], Cell["\<\
applies only the identities that are strictly valid in \[ScriptD]-dimensional \
space time. \
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"92ae3b00-bef4-4f2f-8256-9aff71824b13"]},
   {Cell["      ", "TableRowIcon",ExpressionUUID->
     "bba42a2a-faff-43f4-b15a-4db7782160a2"], 
    TemplateBox[{
      Cell[
       TextData["EvanescenceFree"]], "paclet:Matchete/ref/EvanescenceFree", 
      "Matchete Package Symbol"},
     "PackageLink",
     BaseStyle->"2ColumnTableMod"], Cell[TextData[{
     "reduces operators to a physical (four-dimensional) basis using the \
evanescent prescription and then performs a finite evanescent shift to remove \
resulting evanescent operators. This option requires that the imput is a ",
     StyleBox["full valid Lagrangian",
      FontWeight->"Bold"],
     " and not just a part.  "
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"c0a0461d-cd91-4bc8-9991-bf2767671567"]},
   {Cell["      ", "TableRowIcon",ExpressionUUID->
     "d07d2221-4ee6-468a-9f0f-a4af7a54422e"], 
    TemplateBox[{
      Cell[
       TextData["Evanescent"]], "paclet:Matchete/ref/Evanescent", 
      "Matchete Package Symbol"},
     "PackageLink",
     BaseStyle->"2ColumnTableMod"], Cell["\<\
reduces operators to a physical (four-dimensional) basis using the evanescent \
prescription. The resulting evanescent operators are kept in the output. \
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"70365c4d-5181-4a86-a8e9-777e379ed1a1"]},
   {Cell["      ", "TableRowIcon",ExpressionUUID->
     "307bd9e9-2c28-4bb6-b6f6-c510ff0b9d02"], 
    TemplateBox[{
      Cell[
       TextData["FourDimensional"]], "paclet:Matchete/ref/FourDimensional", 
      "Matchete Package Symbol"},
     "PackageLink",
     BaseStyle->"2ColumnTableMod"], Cell[TextData[{
     "simplifies with four-dimensional identities. This is ",
     StyleBox["incompatible with other \[ScriptD]-dimensional calculations",
      FontWeight->"Bold"],
     ", such as one-loop matching."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"df16ff5b-339e-4dd8-a97a-36bd8dcad2e9"]}
  }]], "2ColumnTableMod",
 GridBoxOptions->{
 GridBoxBackground->{
  "Columns" -> {{None}}, "Rows" -> {None, None, None, {None}}},
 GridBoxDividers->{"Rows" -> {{True, True, True, True, True}}}},
